{"seq":2,"slug":"system-dynamics","title":"系统动力学","stage":"DONE","category":"systems-thinking","chapterCount":5,"docCount":21,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"系统动力学-简介\">系统动力学 简介</h1><p>系统动力学是一门研究复杂系统随时间变化行为的学科。它由杰伊·福瑞斯特在20世纪50年代创立，通过建立数学模型和计算机仿真来揭示系统行为的内在机制。对于工程师和技术管理者而言，系统动力学提供了一套严谨的方法论，用于理解为什么系统常常表现出违反直觉的行为。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向希望深入理解系统行为并具备一定分析思维基础的读者。你不需要高等数学背景，但对变量之间因果关系的兴趣以及基本的定量思维将帮助你更好地掌握建模方法。了解系统思维基础概念（如反馈回路）会让学习过程更加顺畅。</p>\n<p>全书共分三章，从基本构件到建模方法，再到实际应用场景，构成完整的学习路径。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>存量与流量</strong>介绍系统动力学最核心的概念工具。存量是系统中可累积的量，流量是改变存量的速率。理解这对基本概念是构建任何系统动力学模型的基础，你将通过浴缸类比等直观方式掌握存量流量的本质。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>建模与仿真</strong>教授将系统认知转化为可运行模型的方法和工具。从因果回路图的绘制到仿真软件的使用，再到模型验证的原则，这一章将帮助你从定性分析迈向定量分析。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>政策设计</strong>将建模能力应用于实际干预决策。你将理解为什么好的政策意图常常产生坏的结果，学习识别政策阻力的来源，并掌握设计稳健干预策略的方法。</p>\n<p>推荐按章节顺序学习。存量与流量是建模的基本语言，建模与仿真是将理解转化为可验证假设的桥梁，政策设计则是整个学科的实践落地。如果你已经熟悉存量流量概念，可以直接进入第二章。对于关注决策效果的管理者，第三章可以独立阅读，但建议至少浏览第一章以建立共同语言。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stock-and-flow","title":"存量与流量","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/stock-and-flow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stock-flow-fundamentals","title":"存量与流量基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/stock-and-flow/stock-flow-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"accumulation","title":"累积效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/stock-and-flow/accumulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bathtub-analogy","title":"浴缸类比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/stock-and-flow/bathtub-analogy"},{"seq":4,"slug":"stock-flow-diagrams","title":"存量-流量图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/stock-and-flow/stock-flow-diagrams"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"causal-loop","title":"因果回路与动力学行为","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/causal-loop","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"causal-loop-diagrams","title":"因果环路图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/causal-loop/causal-loop-diagrams"},{"seq":2,"slug":"delays-and-oscillations","title":"延迟与振荡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/causal-loop/delays-and-oscillations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nonlinear-dynamics","title":"非线性动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/causal-loop/nonlinear-dynamics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"modeling-simulation","title":"建模与模拟","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/modeling-simulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"system-dynamics-modeling","title":"系统动力学建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/modeling-simulation/system-dynamics-modeling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"simulation-scenario-analysis","title":"模拟与场景分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/modeling-simulation/simulation-scenario-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sd-software-practice","title":"系统动力学软件实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/modeling-simulation/sd-software-practice"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"modeling-and-simulation","title":"建模与仿真","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/modeling-and-simulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"causal-loop-diagrams","title":"因果回路图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/modeling-and-simulation/causal-loop-diagrams"},{"seq":2,"slug":"simulation-tools","title":"仿真工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/modeling-and-simulation/simulation-tools"},{"seq":3,"slug":"model-validation","title":"模型验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/modeling-and-simulation/model-validation"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"policy-design","title":"政策设计","docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/system-dynamics/policy-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"leverage-points","title":"杠杆点分析","url":"